  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n5x + 4y = 12\n\nxy = 2\n\nCalculations:\n\nLet a = 5x, b = 4y\n\nThen 125x³ + 64y³ = a³ + b³ = (a + b)³ − 3ab(a + b)\n\n⇒ a + b = 5x + 4y = 12\n\n⇒ ab = (5x) × (4y) = 20xy = 20 × 2 = 40\n\n⇒ (a + b)³ = 12³ = 1728\n\n⇒ 3ab(a + b) = 3 × 40 × 12 = 1440\n\n⇒ a³ + b³ = 1728 − 1440 = 288\n\n**∴ 125x³ + 64y³ = 288**",
